# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development if needed.
# Contact form submissions go to adwisecreativity@gmail.com via FormSubmit.
# The first form submission triggers a one-time confirmation email —
# open that email and click Confirm to activate.
#
# The contact form requires an on-page “I’m not a robot” press before send,
# and FormSubmit also shows Google reCAPTCHA after submit (_captcha=true).
